From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yassine Oudjana <y.oudjana@protonmail.com>
Date: Wed, 3 May 2023 16:40:21 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: msm8996pro-oneplus3t: Add msm-id

The stock bootloader on this device needs qcom,msm-id to match DTS and boot.

Signed-off-by: Yassine Oudjana <y.oudjana@protonmail.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8996pro-oneplus3t.dts | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8996pro-oneplus3t.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8996pro-oneplus3t.dts
index cde3ce91b3..b2816815ce 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8996pro-oneplus3t.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8996pro-oneplus3t.dts
@@ -15,6 +15,7 @@ / {
 	qcom,board-id = <8 0 15811 26>,
 			<8 0 15811 27>,
 			<8 0 15811 28>;
+	qcom,msm-id = <305 0x10000>;
 };
 
 &adsp_pil {
